OL,3,GNEWSA'Alcohol and drugs ruined my band
OL,4,A- I'm glad to have another chance'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPhil Campbell still shudders when he
OL,7,Frecalls how his band the Temperance
OL,8,FMovement came to a messy end.
OL,10,FAfter years of hard graft and endless
OL,11,Fgigs at home and abroad, the blues-rock
OL,12,Fgroup were finally tasting regular
OL,13,Fsuccess - but Campbell had become
OL,14,Fincreasingly hooked on drink and drugs.
OL,16,FIt eventually led the Glaswegian singer
OL,17,Fto leave the band, and attempt to get
OL,18,Fhis own life back on track.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
