OL,3,GNEWSA'Alcohol and drugs ruined my band
OL,4,A- I'm glad to have another chance'
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow the group have not only reunited
OL,7,Fbut brought out a new album, marking a
OL,8,Ffresh chapter that at one stage seemed
OL,9,Fan unlikely prospect.
